<h1>About RIPS</h1>
{% include "partials/about-nav.njk" %}
<div class="about-layout">
<div class="prose">
  <section aria-labelledby="overview">
    <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
    <p>{{ settings.name }} (RIPS) is a private educational institute in {{ settings.place }}. It offers BS and intermediate programs in health sciences, computing, management and the humanities.</p>
    <p>The campus has medical and science labs, classrooms and a computer lab, a library, a student lounge and a separate Admission Office, as shown in the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ccsk4uAyFLM" rel="noopener">RIPS campus tour <span class="small">(opens YouTube)</span></a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="vision">
    <h2 id="vision">Vision and mission</h2>
    <h3>Vision</h3>
    <p>To be a leading institute in Pakistan for professional education, producing skilled, ethical and compassionate graduates who serve their communities and the nation.</p>
    <h3>Mission</h3>
    <p>To provide quality, affordable and industry-relevant education in health sciences, computing, management and the humanities, combining strong theory with hands-on practice so students become confident, responsible professionals.</p>
  </section>
  {#- Messages from the Chairman and Principal go here once they are written and approved (Doc 05 Q02). #}
  <section aria-labelledby="leadership">
    <h2 id="leadership">Leadership</h2>
    <p>Chairman: Colonel (R) Ghulam Mustafa Hussain.</p>
  </section>
  <p>Affiliation and approvals are listed on the <a href="/about/affiliation/">Affiliation &amp; approvals</a> page, and teaching staff on the <a href="/faculty/">Faculty</a> page.</p>
